# What Vercel builds is frontend/ (the project's Root Directory). Everything
# else in this repository is the batch pipeline, and none of it belongs in a
# deployment upload.
#
# data/ alone is 8.4 GB. It is already in .gitignore, which the CLI falls back
# to -- but the fallback stops applying the moment this file exists, so the
# exclusions that matter are repeated here rather than inherited.
data/
.venv/
scripts/
src/
docs/
serving/
*.log
